ns/41256527777/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/check-suites/111825846857","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/41256527777/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/41256527777/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/41256527777/rerun","previous_attempt_url":null,"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/workflows/377547211","head_commit":{"id":"2ac3db17c80ad85d3f01a35e23ead2b8479b5c93","tree_id":"0527edee7daa7ff1b3170bc072721e4b305352d8","message":"build!: link onepipeline 0.97.2 and onetaskgraph 0.12.14\n\nLink the engine release carrying pipeline-link-follow-up-sync, whose plan\nstore (onetaskgraph 0.12.14) makes creates safe to retry and guards a\ncopy's status and priority writes. The test-only onetaskgraph-core and\nonetaskgraph-plugin-api requirements move to the 0.12.14 the engine pins,\nso the lock holds one copy; uuid moves to the 1.29.0 that store requires.\nThe two test CopyRequest literals take the new `conditions` field at its\nempty default (no guard). /healthz reports 0.97.2; no route or payload\nchanges.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the engine types carried by ApiError::from_engine and the\nother engine-typed public items are now onepipeline 0.97.2's.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:21:32Z","author":{"name":"nick","email":"nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal"},"committer":{"name":"nick","email":"nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal"}},"repository":{"id":1327351155,"node_id":"R_kgDOTx3Fcw","name":"onepipeline-ui","full_name":"nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gra